# CODEOWNERS — guardrail ownership for the Software Factory PoC.
#
# Mirrors the H5 hard rule in .github/factory/risk-paths.yml: the files that
# constrain the agent (.github/** and the workflow that gates PRs, CODEOWNERS
# itself, catalog-info.yaml, .dsh/skills/**) are owned by the human maintainer.
# A pull request touching any of these paths must be approved by that owner;
# the agent must never merge changes to its own guardrails.
#
# NOTE: CODEOWNERS records the intended owner. It only blocks merges once the
# `main` branch ruleset requires review from Code Owners (with at least one
# approval). Until that ruleset is enabled the file has no enforcement effect.

# H5 — the guardrails themselves.
/.github/            @philipz
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @philipz
/catalog-info.yaml   @philipz
/.dsh/skills/        @philipz
